    <div class="page-section-group">
      <!--About Intro----------->   
      <div class="page-section" id="intro">

        <div class="abt-count">
          <div class="abt-count-content">

            
            <p class="inner-count-content">
              24
              <br>
              Years
            </p>
            
            <p class="inner-count-content">
              1500+
              <br>
              Team
            </p>
            
            <p class="inner-count-content">
              5
              <br>
              Countries
            </p>
            
            <div class="count-description">
              <p>We are an agile digital technology innovation partner for enterprises, public sector organizations and software product companies (ISVs). We at e-Zest - An Accion Labs Company believe that success and innovation happen with a persistent focus on learning, partnership and result-orientation.</p>
<p><strong>Intent-driven Impact</strong></p>
<p>Often technology partners miss out on the key intents and get narrowly focused only on execution to "scope and time" defined. At e-Zest - An Accion Labs Company, we believe in focusing on the transformative intent and collaborate with our clients to create outcomes and impact even beyond what was originally articulated.</p>
<p><strong>Partnering for Enhanced Outcomes</strong></p>
<p>We understand that true creativity and impact comes from relationships between our team members and client team. The real impact comes when we work closely with the client throughout the rollout, support and maintenance stages of the initiative. This is why many of our clients start with a project and we naturally evolve to be their long-term technology partner.</p>
<p><strong>Team Alchemy</strong></p>
<p>We strive to go beyond the traditional definition of teamwork. What we strive for is creating team alchemy. An alchemy catalyzed by a mix of technology expertise, openness to new ideas, sharing, and communicating in a proactive and purposeful manner. We combine rigor needed for enterprise level application with agility and innovativeness of startup mindset.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>  

        <div class="vision-misson">
          <div class="vision-misson-group-outer">
            <div class="vision-misson-group">
              
              <div class="v-m-content">
                <h2>Vision</h2>
                <p>Be a global digital technology leader, most admired for its people, partnerships &amp; performance.</p>
              </div>
              
              <div class="v-m-content">
                <h2>Mission</h2>
                <p>We are committed to customer success by providing innovative digital solutions in the spirit of true partnership.</p>
              </div>
              
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>


      </div>

