              <h2>CSR</h2>
              <h4></h4>
              <p>e-Zest - An Accion Labs Company believes that the true drive towards working in a coherent, coexistent environment comes from the satisfaction of extending initiatives for a bigger goal, towards the betterment of the society. While we strive to achieve success in the business realm, we have always been consciously contributing to the various needs of society. Our philosophy echoes the sentiment of philanthropy but in the most engaging form. As a corporate, we are committed through our corporate social responsibility (CSR) activities in giving back to the society in many ways than one.</p>
